There has been a lot of talk recently about the endgame being too easy.
Thanks to the spoilers here, Brunhilde the Valkyrie has found herself in the
final stages of her adventure. It has not become boring due to being too
easy - the boredom is in the impossibility of making any progress. She is
fed up of just dodging and hitting things, being bashed to death, having to
repeatedly uncurse stuff ... just repetition.
I know there is a magic portal here somewhere but the number of Monsters
with nasty friends is too great. I think she had everything she needed,
except patience!
